(7751099, 1280573, 273619, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pearlseyes:</b></div><hr/><i> Stunning image.  I''m hoping for some details on what this is and how you captured it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you all for the kind words! This was shot at Hudson Yards in nyc. This is part of the Louis Vuitton store (Ill post a pic). I was trying to use this for the curves challenge but wasn''t thrilled with how it looked. I didn''t have any other abstract pictures at the time so I came back to this and threw a lightroom preset on top. I was planning on shooting Yayoi Kusama''s NYC show but it was closed the one day I went down. What a coincidence :D<br/> <br/><img border="0" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipNbcdA8UHm0JLRMONrXFzMDDZ0lGvzTySysK4FW=s680-w680-h510" xalt="'' . substr(''https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipNbcdA8UHm0JLRMONrXFzMDDZ0lGvzTySysK4FW=s680-w680-h510'', strrpos(''https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/p/AF1QipNbcdA8UHm0JLRMONrXFzMDDZ0lGvzTySysK4FW=s680-w680-h510'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by pearlseyes: Stunning image.  I''m hoping for some details on what this is and how you captured it.   Thank you all for the kind words! This was shot at Hudson Yards in nyc. This is part of the Louis Vuitton store (Ill post a pic). I was trying to use this for the curves challenge but wasn''t thrilled with how it looked. I didn''t have any other abstract pictures at the time so I came back to this and threw a lightroom preset on top. I was planning on shooting Yayoi Kusama''s NYC show but it was closed the one day I went down. What a coincidence :D   ', '2023-06-20 23:08:51.000000', NULL, 0),
